        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-478 (ensure controlled execution — Occupational Health Clinic &amp; Medical Case Management (PA-83.1).) | - operational: centralized case file
Owner: OH Nurse</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2851_Assoc10" sourceRef="W2851_Annotation9" targetRef="W2851_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
