Responsible (R): Store/DC Manager
Accountable (A): OH Nurse Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2856_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2856_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
